eight: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">202</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">6</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">年外语类保送生招生简章》规定，经学校综合考核和学校招生工作领导小组审议，现对学校202</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">6</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">年外语类保送生拟录取名单进行公示，公示期为202</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">6</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">年3月</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">26</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">日至</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">4</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">月</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">9</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">日</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">。</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">公示期间如有异议，可以通过电话或电子邮件方式向我校反馈。</span></p><p style="line-height: calc(100% + 28pt); text-indent: 32pt; text-align: justify;"><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">对于公示无异议的拟录取考生，学校将按照教育部的相关要求将相关信息上报教育部阳光高考平台，拟录取的考生可登陆教育部阳光高考信息公开平台的名单公示栏查询，并按照各省招办的要求办理后续相关事宜。</span></p><table class="docx_5" style="width: 775px; table-layout: fixed; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;"><colgroup><col data-offset-left="278.5" data-offset-right="361.03125" data-resize-pixel="82.53125" data-resize-percent="10.649193548387096" style="width: 10.6492%;"><col data